{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>Yetter</b> — a noun on the pattern of ʿatel, meaning: the righteous has advantage over his fellow." "<b>And the way of the wicked</b> — and their evil way is what leads them astray. Likewise תועים are those who stray from the straight path."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:25.952562086Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}